          "questionnaire.question.bauchumfang.help": "After breathing out normally, measure approximately halfway between your lowest palpable rib and the top of your hip bone. Abdominal fat is metabolically active, and the waist-to-height ratio complements BMI as a practical marker of central fat distribution. If you do not know the value or are pregnant, simply leave the field blank.",
