          "questionnaire.question.rauchen.help": "Stopping smoking is worthwhile at any age. After just one day, irritation of the airways begins to decrease; within a few months, circulation and lung function improve. After about one year, the risk of coronary heart disease is approximately half that of someone who continues to smoke. Your sense of smell also recovers, food tastes better and you feel more capable.",
